{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっきりーーーーーー\n今日から春休み！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親友に誕プレ渡した！\nおめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/23/4439276/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/23/4439276/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手作りのネックレスと紅茶\n喜んでくれたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/23/4439276/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/23/4439276/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"趣味合うし、一緒に作るのも楽しい！\n材料買って2人でカフェいって\nのんびりアトリエ。\nかわいいの完成したね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後服を買った！\n一日でこんなに買ったの初めてだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/23/4439276/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、ワンピースばっかりなの。\n個握で着るぞーいえいいえーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は高いヒールがある靴を履く。\n慣れよう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高いヒール靴で階段降りるのこわ。\nというかヒールがなくても\n階段降りるのがこわいんだ。\n誰かに掴まるか、\n手すりがないとだめなんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/23/4439276/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻に髪の毛が通過。\n前髪が長い！切りたい！切る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}